sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant SNS as SNS Topic
    participant Lambda as critical-notifier
    participant Control as DynamoDB controle
    participant SES as Amazon SES
    participant Admin as Administrador

    SNS->>Lambda: Envelope SNS com CriticalFeedbackEvent
    Lambda->>Lambda: Extrai e valida a mensagem SNS
    Lambda->>Control: Adquire controle idempotente
    Control-->>Lambda: Processamento permitido
    Lambda->>Lambda: Monta a mensagem de urgência
    Lambda->>SES: Solicita o envio do e-mail
    Lambda->>Control: Marca envio concluído
    SES-->>Admin: Entrega a notificação
